			"notes": "Fabric utility client for Minecraft 1.21.11.\n\n## Install\n\n1. Download `NovaClient-06.1.jar`.\n2. Drop it in `.minecraft/mods/`.\n3. Launch the 1.21.11 Fabric profile and press Right Shift.\n\nRequires Fabric Loader 0.19.2 or newer, Fabric API, and Java 21.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Auto Spear rebuilt.** It now holds the kinetic charge whenever a player is in range and aims the contact ray at them, with optional silent aim and a frame smooth humanized turn. The previous version demanded a closing run before it would even start charging, so the spear's arm delay ate the pass and it almost never landed a hit. Range default drops from 42m to 20m, and Turn Speed plus Silent Aim are now exposed in the panel.\n\n**Rebranded to NovaClient.** Display name and metadata updated. Mod id stays `profps` so existing configs keep loading."
